			problem: "A force $\\vec{F} = (0, 4, 0)\\text{ N}$ acts at position $\\vec{r} = (3, 0, 0)\\text{ m}$. Find $\\vec{\\tau} = \\vec{r} \\times \\vec{F}$.",
